{"message":"For a personal card, the strongest currently documented sign-up offer is the EcoCard: spend $5,000 in eligible purchases within your first month and earn 2,000 sustainability points, worth about $20 when redeemed as a statement credit or Rho-Bank checking deposit. There is no stated minimum credit score, but it has a $50 annual fee and a 19.99% APR if you carry a balance. The offer is available for accounts opened from August 1 through December 15, 2025, and the account must remain open and in good standing when the bonus is awarded.

A previously advertised Silver Rewards Card offer—$500 after $2,000 of spending—expired June 30, 2025, so it is no longer available.

If you’re considering a business card, the Business Bronze Rewards Card offers a $500 statement credit after $10,000 in eligible spending within the first two months, with no annual fee. Tell me whether you want a personal or business card, and roughly how much you can comfortably spend during the introductory period, and I can help identify the better fit."}
